  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "Integration cut 3 (composition over union): `read photo.png, write to %photo%` followed\nby an if on `%photo.Path.Exists%` against a real on-disk file evaluates true. Proves\nthe typed-property catalog lets the LLM navigate image → Path(path) → Exists, and that\nthe file-backed image carries a non-null Path facet.",
